== Splash Wave Pool schedule_changes "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafit"
- IGNORED date-context "Monday, December 22 to Friday, January 2"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafit"
- NOTICE "See Winter Break schedule."
    date text: "Monday, December 22 to Friday, January 2"
    dates: 2025-12-22 Mon to 2026-01-02 Fri
    effects: see-schedule "Winter Break schedule" "https://ottawa.ca/en/splash-wave-pool-holiday-drop-schedule"
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafit"

== Splash Wave Pool special_hours
- UNPARSED freeform "The air heater at our facility is not working. The building may feel colder than usual."
    phrase: "The air heater at our facility is not working"
    at: facility
- NOTICE "The lap pool heater is out of order, the water will feel colder."
    match: NONE
    phrase: "The lap pool heater is out of order, the water will feel colder"
    amenity: "lap pool"
    at: facility
